        <title id="one-api-three-doors-title">One API for people and agents</title>
        <desc id="one-api-three-doors-desc">A person uses the web app and an AI agent uses the CLI or the MCP server; all three doors call the same FastAPI API, which applies the same sign-in and data rules, is the only part that opens the Postgres database, and uses Google or Logto for sign-in.</desc>
